OL,3,GNEWSAHeathland plan to support two rare
OL,4,Aspecies of ant
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo of the UK's rarest ant species are
OL,7,Fbeing supported by a new conservation
OL,8,Fproject.
OL,10,FChiefs at Devon Wildlife Trust said
OL,11,Fthey plan to improve the heathland
OL,12,Fhomes of both the narrow-headed and
OL,13,Ferratic ants, and start new colonies at
OL,14,Fsuitable nearby sites.
OL,16,FThe only English population of the
OL,17,Fnarrow-headed ant lives in the trust's
OL,18,FChudleigh Knighton Heath nature reserve
OL,19,Fand the nationally scarce erratic ant
OL,20,Fwas recently discovered at the
OL,21,Fcharity's Bovey Heathfield nature
OL,22,Freserve.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
